<title>INDIA: INDIA-STCI TWO-WAY QUOTES ON SECURITIES - AUG 8.</title>
<headline>INDIA-STCI TWO-WAY QUOTES ON SECURITIES - AUG 8.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Securities Trading Corporation of India (STCI) on Friday announced its two-way quotes for dated government securities and treasury bills</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>	  Indicative opening quotes for govt securities</p>
